    "name": "Mid-Century Collection",
    "author": "kat",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "A coherent five-piece furniture line: dining chair, armchair, sofa, coffee table, side table. One wood tone, one upholstery color, one leg profile, real furniture proportions (1 world unit = 1 foot, derived from ART-PIPELINE-CALIBRATION.md's floor-tile scale) — not five unrelated generated objects. Wood/upholstery colors deliberately separated in lightness/saturation (dark walnut vs. lighter saturated rust), not just hue — a first pass with both colors mid-toned rendered as a visually flat, nearly monotone silhouette once shaded."
  },
